WEBVTT

01:41.560 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.740 --> 01:49.009
[Episode 5]

02:02.280 --> 02:03.480
Is this what you meant by "alright"?

02:07.360 --> 02:08.550
Just a bit of cold poison left.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.190
No worries.

02:11.300 --> 02:12.220
I'll be fine by tomorrow.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.080
You've fully recovered?

03:14.390 --> 03:14.960
I'm fine now.

03:16.000 --> 03:16.840
Did you

03:18.079 --> 03:18.870
guard me all night?

03:22.470 --> 03:23.280
You got hurt because of me.

03:23.850 --> 03:24.500
If I left,

03:25.030 --> 03:25.710
and you got chronically ill,

03:25.710 --> 03:26.910
I'd be the one to blame, right?

03:29.960 --> 03:30.810
Shui, you're indeed

03:30.840 --> 03:31.870
a nice person with a conscience.

03:36.270 --> 03:37.340
Since everything is done,

03:37.910 --> 03:38.680
let's hurry back now.

03:38.950 --> 03:39.540
No rush.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.120
Today is kind of special.

03:45.910 --> 03:46.360
What?

03:46.930 --> 03:48.120
Don't you remember what day it is?

03:48.520 --> 03:49.430
It's your birthday!

03:49.940 --> 03:51.850
I should celebrate it for you.

03:55.310 --> 03:55.870
Don't bother.

03:56.710 --> 03:57.870
I'm not interested

03:58.450 --> 03:59.240
in boring things like this.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.910
How about I let you out for a day off?

04:04.370 --> 04:04.970
I don't want that either.

04:06.190 --> 04:07.800
I'll release you from the jade tablet,

04:07.820 --> 04:09.070
and you can have fun today!

04:09.630 --> 04:11.150
Just go wherever you want.

04:11.750 --> 04:12.280
Off you go.

04:17.800 --> 04:21.240
[Meeting Hall, Mount Wester]

04:20.510 --> 04:21.070
Qingge,

04:22.240 --> 04:24.040
the disciple you said you were going to take in

04:24.270 --> 04:25.040
is Su Yishui?

04:26.390 --> 04:27.000
Yeah.

04:27.870 --> 04:29.270
That boy's really talented.

04:29.800 --> 04:31.130
I thought it'd take him five years to form a core,

04:31.430 --> 04:33.000
but he nailed it in just three years.

04:33.310 --> 04:34.030
Qingge,

04:35.250 --> 04:36.659
he is the son of Prince Ping.

04:37.550 --> 04:38.240
You don't allow

04:38.270 --> 04:39.600
our Heavenly Sect to get involved in imperial affairs,

04:40.270 --> 04:40.800
but why

04:40.800 --> 04:42.070
did you take in Su Yishui as your disciple?

04:42.830 --> 04:44.000
As my disciple,

04:44.480 --> 04:46.040
he will no longer be related to the imperial family.

04:46.870 --> 04:47.720
That's not true.

04:49.870 --> 04:51.480
His Majesty hasn't named an heir yet,

04:51.950 --> 04:52.920
while his condition has deteriorated.

04:53.960 --> 04:54.840
My father and Prince Ping

04:54.870 --> 04:56.310
will inevitably fight each other one day.

04:58.010 --> 04:58.690
At that time, Su Yishui

04:58.720 --> 04:59.950
will surely side with Prince Ping.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.240
Someone who has struggled to survive like him

05:04.360 --> 05:05.410
can't be easily controlled.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.300
Struggled to survive?

05:09.250 --> 05:09.860
Before falling out

05:09.890 --> 05:11.330
with Prince Ping,

05:11.680 --> 05:12.410
my father heard he found

05:12.430 --> 05:14.110
his lost son and brought his son back to the mansion.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.750
As fellow members of the imperial family,

05:16.730 --> 05:17.930
my father chose a day

05:18.270 --> 05:19.390
and brought me to meet him.

05:20.480 --> 05:21.570
Greetings, Uncle.

05:21.600 --> 05:22.040
Good boy...

05:22.200 --> 05:23.130
Unexpectedly, Prince Ping

05:23.160 --> 05:24.070
said his son who just returned home

05:24.160 --> 05:25.070
was feeling under the weather

05:25.430 --> 05:26.390
and bedridden for recovery.

05:26.830 --> 05:27.630
So he couldn't meet us.

05:28.680 --> 05:29.360
Then my father

05:29.360 --> 05:31.040
just had tea and chatted with Prince Ping.

05:30.540 --> 05:32.740
[Little Su Yu]

05:32.110 --> 05:33.830
I was too young and restless to sit still,

05:34.360 --> 05:36.409
so I snuck out to wander around Prince Ping's residence.

05:37.480 --> 05:39.120
Then I accidentally stumbled into the back garden

05:39.830 --> 05:41.159
and heard weird noises there.

05:40.050 --> 05:42.010
[Be Righteous]

05:42.120 --> 05:43.120
Out of curiosity,

05:43.770 --> 05:44.810
I went to take a look.

05:48.750 --> 05:49.920
Later I found out

05:50.940 --> 05:52.370
that boy was Su Yishui.

05:53.230 --> 05:54.750
Didn't expect Shui

05:56.370 --> 05:57.620
to be such a poor little thing.

05:58.800 --> 05:59.720
Having gone through all this,

06:00.500 --> 06:01.530
no matter what kind of person he was,

06:01.560 --> 06:03.160
he's definitely been ruined by Prince Ping.

06:04.680 --> 06:05.370
Qingge,

06:06.160 --> 06:07.510
I don't want you to be stabbed in the back

06:08.070 --> 06:09.190
by the person you treat with kindness.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.270
Qingge,

06:10.630 --> 06:11.560
His Highness is right.

06:11.920 --> 06:12.870
You should be cautious.

06:13.630 --> 06:15.310
Prince Ping treated him this way

06:16.040 --> 06:17.430
just in order to forge him

06:17.450 --> 06:18.570
into a deadly blade.

06:19.560 --> 06:20.360
But now,

06:21.070 --> 06:22.600
since he is in Mount Wester,

06:25.510 --> 06:27.120
I will sheathe this blade

06:27.950 --> 06:29.390
and not let him harm others or himself.

06:30.750 --> 06:32.600
What if he goes against your wishes?

07:14.200 --> 07:15.260
[Little Su Yishui]

07:25.220 --> 07:25.900
Young Master,

07:26.420 --> 07:27.940
were you slacking off just now?

07:29.600 --> 07:31.280
I saw you slacking off!

07:32.590 --> 07:33.830
How dare you?

07:33.850 --> 07:34.850
How dare you slack off?

07:34.880 --> 07:35.690
How dare you?

07:36.190 --> 07:37.000
Get out of here!

07:37.920 --> 07:38.950
This is my home!

07:42.930 --> 07:43.680
How dare you talk back?

07:43.700 --> 07:44.650
How dare you?

07:45.300 --> 07:46.360
How did I end up with

07:46.390 --> 07:47.430
such a burden like you?

07:47.450 --> 07:48.300
Don't ever come back again.

07:48.330 --> 07:48.880
Understand?

08:04.820 --> 08:05.310
Babe,

08:06.190 --> 08:07.310
I got you a present.

08:08.140 --> 08:09.170
Go and take a look.

08:09.950 --> 08:10.390
Okay.

08:10.410 --> 08:10.800
Go.

08:10.820 --> 08:11.030
Come on.

08:11.950 --> 08:12.190
Let's go.

08:30.580 --> 08:33.299
[Jiang, Su Yishui's Mother]

08:53.890 --> 08:54.940
What are you doing here?

08:56.510 --> 08:57.200
I have squared up

08:58.230 --> 08:59.540
with your father.

09:04.170 --> 09:05.360
We're no longer related.

09:10.680 --> 09:12.760
Today is my babe's first day at school.

09:12.790 --> 09:13.840
It should be a happy day.

09:14.840 --> 09:15.480
Who is it?

09:16.410 --> 09:17.730
[Jiang's Lover]

09:24.200 --> 09:25.360
Get out of here

09:26.440 --> 09:27.610
don't come back to cause me trouble.

09:53.670 --> 09:55.550
Well, well, look who's here.

09:55.980 --> 09:57.000
Isn't this my son's biological father

09:57.030 --> 09:58.600
who hasn't shown up for ten years?

09:59.030 --> 10:00.670
What brings you here today

10:00.670 --> 10:01.790
to finally acknowledge your son?

10:02.270 --> 10:04.030
I've been feeding

10:04.220 --> 10:05.950
and raising him with great effort.

10:06.230 --> 10:07.480
You can't just take him away

10:07.480 --> 10:08.270
as you want.

10:11.120 --> 10:13.480
You should at least give some compensation.

10:20.190 --> 10:22.070
Do you think I'm underselling my son?

10:22.390 --> 10:23.440
This small amount of money

10:23.750 --> 10:24.720
is nowhere near enough.

10:25.470 --> 10:26.600
What else do you want then?

10:28.510 --> 10:29.240
Let me go!

10:30.830 --> 10:33.750
44 jin and 11 liang.

10:35.320 --> 10:35.720
See?

10:36.020 --> 10:37.150
He's this heavy.

10:37.550 --> 10:39.080
You should at least give me

10:39.790 --> 10:41.120
30 taels per jin!

10:45.010 --> 10:46.010
White jade,

10:46.770 --> 10:48.600
enough for you to buy another house.

10:52.790 --> 10:53.910
Fine...

10:54.120 --> 10:55.270
This is enough now.

11:00.480 --> 11:01.200
You can take him.

11:04.120 --> 11:04.840
Mom!

11:05.630 --> 11:07.440
I promise if you hit me and scold me,

11:07.470 --> 11:08.820
I won't hide anymore.

11:09.360 --> 11:10.590
Please let me go back!

11:11.840 --> 11:12.480
Now

11:12.480 --> 11:13.480
is the perfect time

11:13.520 --> 11:14.430
for you to repay me!

11:16.670 --> 11:17.220
Mom!

11:19.030 --> 11:20.700
You have two choices now.

11:23.270 --> 11:23.840
One,

11:24.510 --> 11:26.240
stay out here and freeze to death.

11:26.900 --> 11:27.570
Two,

11:27.690 --> 11:29.740
be a good boy, get in the carriage, and come home with me.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.960
Mom!

11:36.350 --> 11:37.040
Mom!

11:37.250 --> 11:38.720
Please open the door!

11:38.720 --> 11:39.840
I won't leave!

11:39.860 --> 11:41.570
I'm not patient and won't wait.

11:42.160 --> 11:43.040
I'll count to three.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.030
Mom!

11:44.440 --> 11:45.030
One.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.150
Mom!

11:47.170 --> 11:48.080
I promise

11:48.110 --> 11:50.110
I'll only eat one bite of food every day.

11:50.390 --> 11:52.840
I promise I won't waste much money.

11:52.860 --> 11:53.500
Two.

11:57.960 --> 11:58.840
Three.

11:59.220 --> 11:59.830
Mom...

12:04.720 --> 12:05.870
Mom!

12:06.470 --> 12:08.520
Mom, please open the door!

12:08.550 --> 12:09.640
Mom!

12:14.560 --> 12:15.870
Mom!

12:19.840 --> 12:23.170
Mom, please open the door! Mom!

12:46.980 --> 12:47.980
Mom...

12:51.920 --> 12:53.200
He's got something in his hands!

12:54.480 --> 12:55.030
Grab it!

12:55.950 --> 12:57.150
Give it to me...

12:57.150 --> 12:57.670
Give me that!

12:57.670 --> 12:58.510
It's mine, mine!

12:58.530 --> 12:59.250
It's mine!

12:59.280 --> 12:59.890
It's mine!

12:59.910 --> 13:00.390
Give it to me!

13:00.520 --> 13:01.280
Give it to me!

13:13.390 --> 13:14.600
Here, take this.

13:14.650 --> 13:15.100
Mom.

13:15.230 --> 13:15.750
Come on.

13:18.850 --> 13:19.850
Here, put this on.

13:21.600 --> 13:22.390
It's chilling cold.

13:23.550 --> 13:24.600
Come on, hang in there.

13:24.620 --> 13:25.760
We're almost home.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.630
Almost there.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.240
Mom...

13:41.690 --> 13:42.240
Mom!

13:42.870 --> 13:43.600
Welcome back!

13:43.600 --> 13:44.320
I'm back.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.440
What's this?

13:47.460 --> 13:48.150
Take a look.

13:49.940 --> 13:50.810
Dried longan?

13:51.230 --> 13:52.530
It's a pity they were pickled after going bad.

13:52.560 --> 13:53.690
But the taste is still not bad.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.510
Try some.

13:55.750 --> 13:56.480
Thank you, Mom!

14:11.550 --> 14:12.870
Mom has abandoned me.

14:13.780 --> 14:15.380
I don't have a home anymore.

14:29.520 --> 14:31.480
[Prince Ping's Residence]

15:37.550 --> 15:38.480
It's on fire here!

15:38.650 --> 15:39.410
Fire!

15:39.680 --> 15:40.840
Get some water! Hurry!

15:41.310 --> 15:42.240
Hurry up...

16:24.250 --> 16:26.140
[Wester Sect]

16:42.950 --> 16:44.170
I told you not to close the door.

16:44.200 --> 16:45.390
We should leave it open for Shui.

16:46.800 --> 16:47.930
It's windy and pouring rain.

16:48.750 --> 16:49.510
Go open the door.

17:10.710 --> 17:15.170
♫After parting, the black silk-like hair turned snow-white♫

17:15.819 --> 17:20.940
♫In secret, I've been missing you, dreaming about you for years♫

17:17.510 --> 17:18.440
You're finally home

17:21.020 --> 17:26.099
♫Awaiting the destined love, a déjà vu so real♫

17:26.339 --> 17:33.380
♫I'd trade three lifetimes of grandeur for your one fleeting bliss♫

17:34.820 --> 17:39.240
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

17:38.380 --> 17:39.140
What are you looking at?

17:39.680 --> 17:40.160
Let's go.

17:40.040 --> 17:45.130
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

17:45.160 --> 17:49.950
♫Only after I met you♫

17:50.270 --> 17:58.080
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

17:58.360 --> 18:03.370
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

18:03.400 --> 18:08.630
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

18:09.000 --> 18:14.040
♫Using the unfinished fate♫

18:14.230 --> 18:19.250
♫To exchange for endless reunions♫

18:19.650 --> 18:24.790
♫Maybe we have not only the past♫

18:24.940 --> 18:30.130
♫But also the future with passion never fading away♫

18:30.410 --> 18:35.380
♫With endless time to write our story♫

18:35.640 --> 18:39.750
♫We fulfill the vow forged though many lifetimes♫

18:40.040 --> 18:45.400
♫From now onwards♫

18:55.750 --> 18:56.350
it's still warm.

18:56.790 --> 18:57.400
Just grab a bite.

18:57.920 --> 18:58.830
I made you birthday noodles.

19:07.050 --> 19:07.640
I'm not hungry.

19:12.640 --> 19:13.440
What about the gift?

19:13.690 --> 19:14.250
Do you want it?

19:21.160 --> 19:21.790
What's this?

19:31.510 --> 19:32.030
Come on.

19:33.880 --> 19:34.640
Toss it into the soil.

19:39.490 --> 19:40.240
Hurry.

20:13.440 --> 20:13.960
How is it?

20:14.440 --> 20:15.030
Do you like it?

20:16.070 --> 20:17.350
It's just a tree.

20:18.350 --> 20:18.920
Shui,

20:19.510 --> 20:20.640
you're wrong about that.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.590
Trees are more valuable than you think.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.230
In spring, it grows green leaves.

20:37.750 --> 20:39.030
In summer, it's a shelter from wind and rain.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.000
In autumn, it bears fruits for us to pick.

20:41.660 --> 20:43.290
In winter, it provides branches for firewood.

20:43.590 --> 20:45.300
In the morning, birds chirp on top.

20:45.880 --> 20:47.400
At noon, it provides shade from the heat.

20:49.920 --> 20:50.550
At night,

20:50.720 --> 20:52.160
we listen to the wind rustling through the leaves,

20:52.830 --> 20:54.420
drinking and chatting under the tree.

20:56.010 --> 20:57.650
With a tree in front of a house,

20:58.180 --> 20:59.580
it's not just a house

21:01.980 --> 21:02.720
but

21:03.550 --> 21:04.070
a home.

21:06.920 --> 21:07.480
How's that?

21:08.200 --> 21:09.200
Feeling better now?

21:12.720 --> 21:13.550
Appreciate the tree.

21:18.050 --> 21:18.720
Have a drink.

21:20.350 --> 21:21.160
I don't drink.

21:21.700 --> 21:23.980
Wine is the best thing in the world.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.680
Have a sip.

21:28.350 --> 21:29.110
Fine,

21:29.980 --> 21:30.960
I'll drink alone.

21:32.900 --> 21:34.020
This first sip

21:34.440 --> 21:35.160
is a toast to the present,

21:35.820 --> 21:36.720
wishing Shui

21:37.080 --> 21:38.120
a happy birthday.

21:43.950 --> 21:44.670
Nice wine.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.200
This second sip

21:54.350 --> 21:55.070
is to the past.

21:56.240 --> 21:58.110
May we not be stuck in the past

21:58.500 --> 21:59.500
with each day a brand-new beginning.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.800
Freshly picked sweet fruit.

22:04.420 --> 22:05.300
From now on,

22:05.660 --> 22:06.940
we'll only taste sweetness, not bitterness.

22:10.800 --> 22:11.750
I don't need sweetness.

22:13.110 --> 22:14.350
Sweetness makes people forget,

22:15.090 --> 22:16.410
yet bitterness has things engraved in your mind.

22:17.960 --> 22:18.960
I only need bitterness.

22:19.790 --> 22:21.350
It reminds me to never forget.

22:25.790 --> 22:26.480
It's not worthwhile.

22:27.510 --> 22:29.000
Everyone's got their limits.

22:29.830 --> 22:30.880
In the past, you had no choice.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.470
It was filled with bitterness. You can't change it.

22:32.940 --> 22:34.450
Now you can choose on your own.

22:35.400 --> 22:36.720
Why make things difficult for yourself?

22:40.400 --> 22:41.030
How about this?

22:41.790 --> 22:43.400
Next time when something gets you down,

22:43.960 --> 22:45.240
let's just open a jar of good wine

22:45.750 --> 22:47.510
and call our fellows

22:47.830 --> 22:49.510
to get rid of all the unhappiness.

22:51.400 --> 22:52.880
We can call them now.

22:53.550 --> 22:54.240
Mu Qingge!

23:00.400 --> 23:01.510
You know nothing about my past,

23:02.000 --> 23:02.590
and neither do you know

23:02.590 --> 23:03.550
what kind of person I really am.

23:04.280 --> 23:04.800
I don't need

23:04.830 --> 23:05.790
anyone to help me.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.160
Stop being kind to me.

23:09.110 --> 23:09.960
Then tell me

23:10.740 --> 23:12.190
what kind of person you were?

23:12.920 --> 23:13.800
And what kind of person

23:14.030 --> 23:15.440
do you want to become in the future?

23:20.160 --> 23:21.070
I want to become

23:21.070 --> 23:22.160
the most powerful being in the world.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.720
I want those who once despised me

23:25.310 --> 23:26.720
to kneel before me one by one,

23:27.110 --> 23:28.420
begging me to spare their lives.

23:29.800 --> 23:30.760
If you were really

23:30.790 --> 23:32.030
as ruthless as you say,

23:32.760 --> 23:34.040
you wouldn't have let

23:34.070 --> 23:35.240
Prince Zong's second son survive.

23:35.980 --> 23:36.590
I didn't kill him

23:36.590 --> 23:38.000
because I wanted to defy my father's manipulation.

23:38.790 --> 23:39.590
I have my own plans.

23:41.270 --> 23:43.000
So are you planning to scheme against Prince Ping?

23:45.720 --> 23:47.360
You have to be more ruthless and callous than others

23:47.550 --> 23:48.720
to stay on top.

23:50.110 --> 23:50.690
In this world,

23:50.720 --> 23:51.830
if you don't want to be manipulated,

23:52.350 --> 23:53.510
this is the only way to go.

23:53.540 --> 23:54.200
No other choice.

23:57.550 --> 23:58.960
Actually, when I was young,

23:59.960 --> 24:01.440
I almost went astray too.

24:04.350 --> 24:05.540
In that year of the famine,

24:06.200 --> 24:07.200
some bandits wanted me

24:07.200 --> 24:09.070
to put poison into the well of a rich household in the village.

24:10.220 --> 24:11.620
They promised to give me food if I did it.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.480
I didn't want to do it,

24:14.640 --> 24:15.440
but my little sister had already

24:15.460 --> 24:16.570
been starving for days.

24:30.110 --> 24:31.350
It snowed heavily that night.

24:32.510 --> 24:33.440
I pondered over it all night.

24:34.960 --> 24:36.030
If I put the arsenic,

24:37.830 --> 24:39.110
innocent people would die.

24:41.160 --> 24:41.880
If I didn't,

24:43.110 --> 24:44.270
my sister and I would die.

24:44.720 --> 24:45.830
So you put the poison into the well?

24:52.250 --> 24:53.070
I carried my sister on my back

24:53.100 --> 24:54.860
and fled away on that snowy night.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.000
I thought we would die,

24:57.750 --> 24:59.160
but unexpectedly, after we left,

24:59.550 --> 25:00.510
we survived.

25:01.960 --> 25:02.680
Shui,

25:04.270 --> 25:05.200
sometimes people

25:05.810 --> 25:06.410
are like

25:06.440 --> 25:07.880
bugs trapped in a box.

25:08.920 --> 25:10.350
They think they're trapped in dead ends,

25:11.270 --> 25:12.590
but once they break out,

25:13.480 --> 25:14.760
they'll realize how vast the world is.

25:15.400 --> 25:16.310
There are always choices.

25:17.370 --> 25:18.970
You've already left Prince Ping's residence.

25:20.110 --> 25:20.880
I will definitely help you

25:20.880 --> 25:22.020
find another path.

25:39.160 --> 25:39.920
I've asked around.

25:41.000 --> 25:42.070
In the Wester Sect, except for me,

25:42.920 --> 25:44.110
no one else was brought here by force.

25:45.920 --> 25:47.070
You care about me so much.

25:48.420 --> 25:49.500
Is it because of Su Yu?

25:50.360 --> 25:51.550
You two used to be so close.

25:53.310 --> 25:54.350
As I told you before,

25:54.640 --> 25:56.200
it's because you have Five Spirit Roots.

25:56.830 --> 25:58.520
I want you to teach disciples

25:58.550 --> 25:59.830
and build up a reputation for me.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.720
This way, I can just

26:01.750 --> 26:03.240
lead a carefree life,

26:03.240 --> 26:04.640
lying down and enjoying offerings.

26:05.160 --> 26:06.400
You're indispensable

26:06.820 --> 26:07.860
to make my dream come true.

26:09.160 --> 26:10.240
You are indeed so boring.

26:27.830 --> 26:28.410
Have a drink.

27:01.160 --> 27:02.400
No wonder he doesn't drink.

27:03.400 --> 27:05.030
He's such a lightweight!

27:30.310 --> 27:32.070
Junior Su's playing a gentle and soothing melody today.

27:32.270 --> 27:33.580
He's almost like a different person!

27:33.880 --> 27:35.740
Those rabbits and chicks in the cub zoo

27:35.960 --> 27:37.830
are getting along very well with Junior Su.

27:37.920 --> 27:38.480
Really?

27:39.070 --> 27:40.200
Focus on meditation.

27:40.920 --> 27:41.750
Why so talkative?

28:18.030 --> 28:18.830
Weird,

28:19.720 --> 28:20.750
you're about to form your core,

28:21.510 --> 28:22.410
but something's obstructing

28:22.440 --> 28:24.000
the flow of spiritual power in your heart.

28:24.680 --> 28:25.960
Have you ever been seriously injured

28:26.480 --> 28:27.000
or

28:27.110 --> 28:28.680
been hit by any weird spells?

28:30.070 --> 28:31.440
I'm planting this drop of Spirit Spring

28:31.680 --> 28:33.240
into your heart.

28:36.680 --> 28:37.310
No.

28:39.470 --> 28:40.560
Perhaps there's

28:40.590 --> 28:42.240
a trace of innate impurity in your body

28:42.270 --> 28:43.290
that's affecting your cultivation.

28:44.740 --> 28:46.450
The Westerly Valley in the west

28:46.480 --> 28:47.110
can stabilize spiritual power.

28:47.550 --> 28:48.110
Go there

28:48.350 --> 28:49.170
and wait for me.

29:28.500 --> 29:29.630
Take this pill

29:29.830 --> 29:30.590
and focus on meditation.

29:41.060 --> 29:42.650
This pill I just made is extremely bitter.

29:43.590 --> 29:44.830
Take it with the dried longan.

29:45.480 --> 29:46.510
I've added some licorice to it.

29:57.400 --> 29:58.230
Stabilize your spiritual power.

29:58.730 --> 30:00.140
I'll help you form your Golden Core.

30:31.350 --> 30:31.920
It's done!

30:32.310 --> 30:33.000
The Golden Core!

30:33.410 --> 30:34.890
Shui has finally formed a Golden Core

30:34.920 --> 30:35.700
instead of a Demonic Core.

30:43.750 --> 30:44.400
Shui,

30:45.200 --> 30:46.750
you're now a Golden Core cultivator.

30:53.510 --> 30:54.720
Helping me form my core depleted your core energy.

30:55.070 --> 30:55.830
It's nothing.

31:00.290 --> 31:01.250
What happened to your hands?

31:03.370 --> 31:05.470
Just got hurt while picking the immortal herb for that pill.

31:05.860 --> 31:07.340
The Nine-ganoderma Immortal Herb is quite difficult to pick.

31:10.960 --> 31:11.640
Thank you.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.830
Well, well, wonders never cease.

31:16.390 --> 31:17.940
Shui actually said thank you.

31:20.310 --> 31:21.260
Honestly,

31:21.730 --> 31:22.690
what I want to hear now

31:22.720 --> 31:23.550
is not "thank you."

31:28.880 --> 31:29.880
Then what is it?

31:31.680 --> 31:32.830
After so many years here,

31:33.680 --> 31:34.310
isn't it about time

31:34.310 --> 31:35.510
for you to call me master?

31:41.750 --> 31:43.000
Despite my injured hands

31:43.350 --> 31:44.400
and drastic power decline,

31:46.290 --> 31:48.210
-I still can't get you to call me master.
-Master.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.640
Yes,

32:01.640 --> 32:02.350
good boy.

32:31.880 --> 32:32.530
Junior Su,

32:34.200 --> 32:36.010
you advanced to the Golden Core realm just a few days ago.

32:36.240 --> 32:37.480
Yet instead of consolidating your cultivation,

32:37.630 --> 32:38.560
you've been grinding medicine here

32:38.590 --> 32:39.930
and making this scar-removing ointment.

32:39.960 --> 32:40.710
What's the use of that?

32:41.650 --> 32:42.280
I...

32:42.880 --> 32:43.640
I injured my hands.

32:45.030 --> 32:45.830
Is it serious? Let me see.

32:48.510 --> 32:48.960
Nope.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.070
Shui,

33:03.270 --> 33:03.830
what's the matter?

33:07.280 --> 33:08.430
It's medicine for your hand injury.

33:24.760 --> 33:27.140
[Prince Zong's Residence]

33:28.110 --> 33:28.920
Su Yishui?

33:29.720 --> 33:30.110
Yes.

33:30.590 --> 33:31.960
Can't believe someone like Su Yishui

33:32.030 --> 33:34.050
would personally make an ointment for Qingge

33:34.470 --> 33:36.790
and lose composure at her doorstep.

33:37.550 --> 33:39.110
He must have feelings for Qingge.

33:40.870 --> 33:42.070
No wonder Qingge

33:42.410 --> 33:43.650
was willing to offend the Eternal Sect

33:43.680 --> 33:44.790
just to take him in as her disciple.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.630
And she even allows him to do whatever he wants

33:46.660 --> 33:47.580
on Mount Wester.

33:48.550 --> 33:50.000
Treating him like this

33:50.260 --> 33:52.260
would make him fall in love, of course.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.010
However,

33:55.550 --> 33:57.350
what's most concerning is...

33:57.960 --> 33:58.680
What?

34:00.410 --> 34:01.890
Qingge is nice to all her disciples.

34:02.070 --> 34:03.560
But her exceptional care for Su Yishui

34:03.590 --> 34:04.640
is indeed uncommon.

34:05.350 --> 34:06.650
Could it be that

34:07.310 --> 34:09.190
Qingge also has feelings for Su Yishui?

34:12.070 --> 34:13.920
With Qingge's free-spirited nature,

34:14.590 --> 34:15.840
how could she be bound by feelings?

34:16.960 --> 34:18.630
Otherwise, I would have

34:18.920 --> 34:20.230
proposed to her already.

34:21.030 --> 34:22.360
I've always kept the position

34:23.190 --> 34:24.400
of the legitimate son's wife for her.

34:28.280 --> 34:30.230
One can never get love by force.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.030
As the saying goes,

34:32.960 --> 34:35.150
the person by your side

34:35.440 --> 34:37.000
is the one most worthy of cherishing.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.510
Guards!

34:46.320 --> 34:46.710
Yes, Your Highness.

34:47.320 --> 34:48.030
Give my order.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.110
Starting today,

34:50.510 --> 34:52.280
recruit skilled craftsmen to Mount Wester.

34:53.070 --> 34:53.880
It's time to build

34:53.880 --> 34:55.070
a proper palace for Qingge.

34:56.670 --> 34:57.800
It shall be called

35:00.000 --> 35:00.590
Consonance Palace.

35:01.230 --> 35:01.550
Understood.

35:06.560 --> 35:08.140
Being close is good,

35:09.030 --> 35:10.680
but having consonance is even better.

35:18.510 --> 35:19.840
Mu Qingge...

35:20.370 --> 35:22.410
[Wester Sect]

35:28.440 --> 35:29.280
What is this all about?

35:30.320 --> 35:31.550
Prince Zong's legitimate son, Su Yu,

35:31.770 --> 35:32.520
is going to build

35:32.550 --> 35:33.360
the Consonance Palace for our Wester Sect.

35:35.760 --> 35:36.800
Unsolicited favors

35:37.320 --> 35:38.320
are always suspicious.

35:39.710 --> 35:41.440
Yu has already spent the money.

35:41.630 --> 35:43.020
It would be improper to reject his goodwill.

35:43.880 --> 35:44.810
During this time,

35:44.840 --> 35:46.070
Zeng Yi, you stay here and watch over the place.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.110
You

35:47.510 --> 35:48.190
go down the mountain with me.

35:48.710 --> 35:49.280
Go down the mountain?

35:49.760 --> 35:50.440
We're going to the capital

35:50.910 --> 35:52.180
to handle an emergency.

35:57.160 --> 35:59.190
[Fair, Capital]

36:02.590 --> 36:03.360
Snacks from Dewei Restaurant.

36:03.670 --> 36:04.440
Have some while they're hot.

36:05.570 --> 36:07.170
So this is your "emergency"?

36:08.210 --> 36:09.940
Isn't eating, drinking, and having fun important?

36:10.320 --> 36:11.230
This is really tasty.

36:11.710 --> 36:12.480
Yu said

36:12.590 --> 36:13.960
it's even better than what the imperial chefs make.

36:16.080 --> 36:16.880
Why should I eat

36:16.880 --> 36:17.880
things recommended by others?

36:20.360 --> 36:20.800
Well,

36:21.230 --> 36:23.000
what about a recommendation from your master?

36:25.190 --> 36:26.150
This collection of entertainment

36:26.290 --> 36:27.790
contains the essence

36:27.810 --> 36:29.290
of your master's lifelong research.

36:29.590 --> 36:30.920
Let me take you to try them one by one.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.670
For cuisines and having fun,

36:32.880 --> 36:33.960
you even wrote a book?

36:34.240 --> 36:35.550
Cuisines are worthy of delving into!

36:36.010 --> 36:37.740
Only by tasting all the flavors in the world

36:37.980 --> 36:39.830
can you comprehend the essence of the great way.

36:41.710 --> 36:42.190
Come on,

36:42.550 --> 36:43.360
after finishing all these,

36:43.480 --> 36:44.920
I'll take you on a proper tour of the capital.

36:55.630 --> 36:56.080
Sir,

36:56.170 --> 36:57.200
one set of fried silkworm pupae, please.

36:57.800 --> 36:58.480
Fresh out of the wok.

36:59.030 --> 36:59.630
Enjoy your meal.

37:02.880 --> 37:03.280
Here,

37:05.530 --> 37:06.670
It's so good!

37:14.800 --> 37:15.670
Take a look, everyone!

37:15.710 --> 37:16.710
Tossing the flower balls!

37:16.730 --> 37:17.940
Come and take a look!

37:19.800 --> 37:20.280
Try it.

37:30.920 --> 37:33.510
Bravo!

37:56.440 --> 37:58.070
Waist drums, waist drums for sale!

37:58.170 --> 37:59.780
Waist drums for sale, waist drums for sale!

38:00.110 --> 38:00.480
Young lady,

38:00.510 --> 38:01.350
come take a look at the waist drums.

38:01.670 --> 38:02.800
This is the best-selling one in my shop.

38:15.960 --> 38:19.070
[Enrollment Dept. of Wester Sect]

38:19.550 --> 38:20.400
Turn around and let me see.

38:27.880 --> 38:29.280
Is this also what you called an emergency?

38:30.240 --> 38:31.490
After the Consonance Palace is built,

38:31.510 --> 38:32.580
Mount Wester will expand greatly.

38:32.880 --> 38:34.410
Won't it be too empty with just us there?

38:34.970 --> 38:36.780
So we need to enroll a few disciples with various talents,

38:36.810 --> 38:38.140
and good looks.

38:39.340 --> 38:40.460
The point is being good-looking, right?

38:41.980 --> 38:42.890
How about that one just now?

38:43.750 --> 38:44.670
He has good potential

38:45.100 --> 38:45.690
as well as

38:45.910 --> 38:47.030
good looks.

38:48.440 --> 38:48.960
I don't know.

38:49.430 --> 38:50.330
Where are you going?

38:50.450 --> 38:51.090
To buy some fruit.

38:51.480 --> 38:53.290
Why are you suddenly going to buy fruit?

38:57.940 --> 38:58.670
I am Wei Jiu.

38:59.190 --> 38:59.710
I have

38:59.740 --> 39:01.140
admired you for a long time, Master Mu.

39:02.630 --> 39:03.750
In what way do you admire me?

39:04.670 --> 39:05.840
Master Mu, you've reached

39:05.870 --> 39:06.870
the Transcendence Realm at such a young age.

39:07.090 --> 39:08.980
I heard that your new disciple, Su Yishui,

39:09.150 --> 39:10.920
formed a Golden Core within just three years.

39:11.410 --> 39:13.310
There must be a shortcut to advancement.

39:13.590 --> 39:14.440
I'm willing to give up

39:14.460 --> 39:15.570
the position of the Scarlet Sect's young lord

39:16.030 --> 39:16.880
to join the Wester Sect instead.

39:18.760 --> 39:19.470
Sorry,

39:19.900 --> 39:21.540
our Shui is exceptionally talented.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.230
There's no shortcut to advancement.

39:24.440 --> 39:25.770
Your aptitude

39:26.160 --> 39:27.010
seems just so-so.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.650
Joining our Wester Sect wouldn't help you much.

39:29.000 --> 39:29.510
Forget about it.

39:32.610 --> 39:33.730
Master Mu, I've heard that

39:33.750 --> 39:35.040
you prefer handsome disciples.

39:35.670 --> 39:36.480
I'm not bragging,

39:36.840 --> 39:38.480
but I think I'm quite a handsome man.

39:38.890 --> 39:40.010
Besides, I've learned many special tricks.

39:40.400 --> 39:41.070
If you take me in,

39:41.370 --> 39:42.240
the Wester Sect will

39:42.280 --> 39:43.320
surely stun the world in the future.

39:43.590 --> 39:44.450
Wei Jiu, right?

39:45.320 --> 39:46.110
Let's put aside everything else.

39:46.710 --> 39:47.710
Just in terms of beauty,

39:48.000 --> 39:49.280
you are nowhere as handsome

39:49.280 --> 39:50.000
as my disciple Su Yishui.

39:50.920 --> 39:52.540
Stun the world? Seriously?

39:54.400 --> 39:55.000
Master Mu,

39:55.740 --> 39:57.300
my beauty is well-known to all.

39:57.740 --> 39:59.140
How could Su Yishui possibly beat me in that?

39:59.430 --> 40:00.740
Are you intentionally embarrassing me, Master Mu?

40:02.070 --> 40:02.590
Shui,

40:02.780 --> 40:03.480
come over here.

40:08.840 --> 40:09.360
Guys,

40:10.030 --> 40:11.070
please tell me.

40:11.800 --> 40:13.510
How does this man look?

40:13.960 --> 40:15.190
Quite good.

40:15.550 --> 40:16.390
Not bad...

40:16.440 --> 40:17.070
Yeah, not bad.

40:17.140 --> 40:17.710
Decent enough.

40:18.840 --> 40:19.440
And how about this one?

40:20.230 --> 40:21.480
Really handsome!

40:23.110 --> 40:25.070
Look at his jaw-dropping beauty!

40:27.450 --> 40:28.330
Well, then compare this person

40:28.360 --> 40:29.590
with decent looks

40:29.960 --> 40:31.230
to this one with jaw-dropping beauty.

40:31.630 --> 40:32.280
Which one do you think

40:32.720 --> 40:33.560
looks better?

40:33.590 --> 40:34.550
The latter one, undoubtedly!

40:34.570 --> 40:35.610
That's right!

40:35.800 --> 40:37.000
Just leave!

40:37.150 --> 40:38.150
Get down!

40:38.760 --> 40:39.510
Go home!

40:40.320 --> 40:40.760
See?

40:41.280 --> 40:42.340
Comparison of goods isn't scary,

40:42.550 --> 40:43.480
But comparison between people is frightening.

40:44.190 --> 40:45.000
You can go home now.

40:49.020 --> 40:49.780
Mu Qingge,

40:50.670 --> 40:52.070
you'll surely regret this one day.

40:52.590 --> 40:53.360
Just you wait!

41:00.760 --> 41:01.400
Shui,

41:02.030 --> 41:03.030
I'm so proud of you!

41:15.400 --> 41:15.920
This is for you.

41:16.630 --> 41:17.280
What's this?

41:18.150 --> 41:19.850
The most important thing during this trip down the mountain

41:20.000 --> 41:20.670
is this.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.030
Take it.

41:23.360 --> 41:24.700
It's a gift for your Golden Core formation.

41:34.840 --> 41:35.440
Shui,

41:36.030 --> 41:37.140
did you have fun in the past few days

41:37.320 --> 41:38.150
in the capital?

41:40.880 --> 41:41.320
Yes.

41:43.070 --> 41:44.030
There is

41:44.500 --> 41:45.420
much more fun

41:45.450 --> 41:46.370
everywhere in this world.

41:46.980 --> 41:47.730
In the future,

41:47.750 --> 41:49.130
I will take you to explore and enjoy them

41:49.630 --> 41:50.700
one by one.

41:51.110 --> 41:52.250
Take this sword

41:52.590 --> 41:53.360
and protect

41:53.850 --> 41:55.240
this interesting mortal world together with me.
